DDE7 DDD8             (    forth6809.asm):01891                  FDB   H_ABORT
DDE9 DF27             (    forth6809.asm):01892                  FDB   QUIT
                      (    forth6809.asm):01893         
                      (    forth6809.asm):01894         ; FIND had no dictionary entry at all - confirmed by checking for
                      (    forth6809.asm):01895         ; any H_FIND label or FCC "FIND" string anywhere in this file
                      (    forth6809.asm):01896         ; before adding this. Its actual implementation (verified before
                      (    forth6809.asm):01897         ; exposing it) already matches the standard stack effect exactly:
                      (    forth6809.asm):01898         ; success pushes xt then 1 (immediate) or -1 (normal); failure
                      (    forth6809.asm):01899         ; reconstructs and pushes the original c-addr, then 0.
DDEB 04               (    forth6809.asm):01900         H_FIND:  FCB   4
