                      (    forth6809.asm):02205                                   ; COLON (sets STATE=-1) and SEMI (sets
                      (    forth6809.asm):02206                                   ; STATE=0, after checking CSP) are the
                      (    forth6809.asm):02207                                   ; correct, sole places STATE should change
                      (    forth6809.asm):02208                                   ; during normal operation - the old QLOOP
