                      (    forth6809.asm):06473                                  ; testing whatever flags an unrelated, earlier
                      (    forth6809.asm):06474                                  ; instruction happened to leave set, not the
                      (    forth6809.asm):06475                                  ; sign of the value just popped. TSTA
