                      (    forth6809.asm):06983                                      ; entirely (the top-of-file note calling
                      (    forth6809.asm):06984                                      ; out "/HOLD and /PAD... remain explicitly
                      (    forth6809.asm):06985                                      ; incomplete/absent" was accurate at the
                      (    forth6809.asm):06986                                      ; time). Answers HOLDMINSIZE (34), not the
                      (    forth6809.asm):06987                                      ; larger PADOFFSET (84) - HOLDMINSIZE is
                      (    forth6809.asm):06988                                      ; specifically the portion of the
                      (    forth6809.asm):06989                                      ; CODEHERE-to-PAD gap reserved for the
                      (    forth6809.asm):06990                                      ; pictured numeric output buffer, the same
                      (    forth6809.asm):06991                                      ; amount WORDMAXCHARS deliberately holds
                      (    forth6809.asm):06992                                      ; back from WORD's own use at the other
                      (    forth6809.asm):06993                                      ; end of that same shared gap. PADOFFSET
                      (    forth6809.asm):06994                                      ; is the total gap width, most of which is
                      (    forth6809.asm):06995                                      ; actually earmarked for WORD's own
                      (    forth6809.asm):06996                                      ; parsing - reporting it here would
                      (    forth6809.asm):06997                                      ; overstate what HOLD can safely use
                      (    forth6809.asm):06998                                      ; without risking collision with whatever
                      (    forth6809.asm):06999                                      ; WORD is doing in the same space.
FDC1 FE1000040054     (    forth6809.asm):07000                  FDB   EN8,EN8L,PADMINSIZE  ; NEW: /PAD, the last of the two
                      (    forth6809.asm):07001                                      ; entries the top-of-file note originally
                      (    forth6809.asm):07002                                      ; flagged as absent - now both present.
                      (    forth6809.asm):07003                                      ; Answers PADMINSIZE (84) directly, per
                      (    forth6809.asm):07004                                      ; ANS's own /PAD meaning (3.3.3.6, "the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07005                                      ; size of the scratch area whose address
                      (    forth6809.asm):07006                                      ; is returned by PAD") - PAD's own region,
                      (    forth6809.asm):07007                                      ; growing upward from PAD itself, distinct
                      (    forth6809.asm):07008                                      ; from HOLDMINSIZE above (which answers
                      (    forth6809.asm):07009                                      ; for a different region entirely, the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07010                                      ; downward-growing pictured-numeric buffer
                      (    forth6809.asm):07011                                      ; in the CODEHERE-to-PAD gap). PADOFFSET
                      (    forth6809.asm):07012                                      ; happens to equal PADMINSIZE numerically
                      (    forth6809.asm):07013                                      ; in this implementation (PADOFFSET EQU
                      (    forth6809.asm):07014                                      ; PADMINSIZE), but /PAD is answered with
                      (    forth6809.asm):07015                                      ; the conceptually correct constant, not
                      (    forth6809.asm):07016                                      ; the coincidentally-equal one.
FDC7 FE1400070000     (    forth6809.asm):07017                  FDB   EN9,EN9L,0    ; NEW: FLOORED - previously the one item
                      (    forth6809.asm):07018                                      ; in this area explicitly left open
                      (    forth6809.asm):07019                                      ; pending its own investigation (unlike
                      (    forth6809.asm):07020                                      ; WORDLISTS, this is a CORE query, not
                      (    forth6809.asm):07021                                      ; tied to an unimplemented optional word
                      (    forth6809.asm):07022                                      ; set, so "false by omission" wasn't the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07023                                      ; right default). Investigated by tracing
                      (    forth6809.asm):07024                                      ; DIVCOMMON (shared by /, MOD, /MOD)
                      (    forth6809.asm):07025                                      ; against this system's own SM/REM and
                      (    forth6809.asm):07026                                      ; FM/MOD: DIVCOMMON restores the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07027                                      ; remainder's sign from DNSIGN (the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07028                                      ; dividend's own original sign) after
                      (    forth6809.asm):07029                                      ; dividing absolute values - exactly
                      (    forth6809.asm):07030                                      ; SM/REM's own logic, confirmed identical
                      (    forth6809.asm):07031                                      ; by direct comparison. FM/MOD, by
                      (    forth6809.asm):07032                                      ; contrast, has an explicit flooring
                      (    forth6809.asm):07033                                      ; adjustment step (correcting the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07034                                      ; quotient and remainder when the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07035                                      ; quotient would be negative with a
                      (    forth6809.asm):07036                                      ; nonzero remainder) that DIVCOMMON does
                      (    forth6809.asm):07037                                      ; not have. This system's primary
                      (    forth6809.asm):07038                                      ; division words (/, MOD, /MOD) use
                      (    forth6809.asm):07039                                      ; symmetric division, not floored -
                      (    forth6809.asm):07040                                      ; FLOORED is 0 (false), a real, meaningful
                      (    forth6809.asm):07041                                      ; answer (recognized query, value false),
                      (    forth6809.asm):07042                                      ; not the "unrecognized" fallthrough
                      (    forth6809.asm):07043                                      ; WORDLISTS correctly uses.
FDCD FE1B000800FF     (    forth6809.asm):07044                  FDB   EN10,EN10L,255  ; NEW: MAX-CHAR - maximum value of any
