FFDC 3606             (    forth6809.asm):07429                  PSHU  D
FFDE BDF64D           (    forth6809.asm):07430                  JSR   TYPE
FFE1 1CAF             (    forth6809.asm):07431                  ANDCC #$AF
FFE3 7EDF24           (    forth6809.asm):07432                  JMP   ABORT
                      (    forth6809.asm):07433         
FFE6 20207761726D     (    forth6809.asm):07434         WARMMSG: FCC   "  warm"
